window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p><b>A warrior's honor meets a fae’s secrets.</b><br> <br> Vesper lives in the shadows, guarding her secrets with the same care she gives her rare flora magic. In the scented court, where every bloom is power, she plays her part while saving for a future far from her haunted past. But when a threatening message arrives, Vesper realizes she can't run forever. How far will she go to protect herself—and the one creature she holds dear?</p> <p>Regalis, with his fierce raptor familiar, stands as a pillar of honor among the elite Fahyli soldiers. Yet beneath the warrior’s exterior lies a heart yearning for a true mate. Fate throws them together in a foggy twist of events: a murder, a kidnapping, and a mystery that binds their fates together.</p> <p>Vesper must decide if she can trust Regalis with the truth she’s buried deep, while Regalis faces the ultimate test—can he forgive the web of lies spun in fear? As past sins collide with present dangers, one question remains: who will make the ultimate sacrifice?</p> <p><b>A Star of Darkness</b> is a pulse-pounding romantasy adventure of intrigue and passion, set in the mesmerizing world of the Scented Court series by A.L. Knorr. Dive into this standalone story where love battles against the shadows of the past, and the magic of flora and fauna weaves a fate neither of these star-crossed lovers saw coming. Set in the world of The Scented Court but can be enjoyed as a standalone. Not YA, but suitable for ages 14+.</p>"; 
